A: If your child misses two classes in a row, there are no refunds, but you can schedule make-up classes through your campus account (see steps in the makeup policy). Make-ups should be registered within the same week of each missed class (week runs Monday–Sunday); you can schedule them before or after the missed sessions. Each student gets five free make-ups per semester; after that, a $5 processing fee applies per additional make-up. Make-ups must be at the same site and level, and rescheduling requires 24 hours' notice. If a desired make-up class is full, contact your campus (call (408) 818-8818 or email your campus) for help.

