A: To advance to the next level students must:

- Meet the age and skill requirements for the next class (each class is designed for specific age groups and skill levels).  
- Successfully complete their current level and demonstrate proficiency in the skills and techniques taught.  
- Be evaluated and approved by their instructor, who assesses progress and readiness based on performance, homework, and independent research.

Also note: some advanced classes (Elite Class, AP Studio Art, Digital Art Portfolio) require a submitted application. Families unsure which level fits can contact any CalColor staff for help.

