===== [89/150]  How is my monthly tuition calculated? =====

Q: How is my monthly tuition calculated?

retrieved: tuition-and-billing=0.615, billing-cycle-2026-2027=0.522, tuition-rates=0.517, discounts=0.422

A: Tuition is billed as a monthly subscription and equals the per-class rate for your class/campus multiplied by the number of classes scheduled in that month’s billing cycle. Billing is prorated if you join mid-cycle (you only pay for the remaining classes that month). Card payments incur a 3% surcharge; E‑Check has no surcharge. For exact per-class rates for your campus, log in to your campus StudioDirector portal or call (408) 818-8818.

===== [90/150]  Why isn't my tuition bill the same amount every month? =====

Q: Why isn't my tuition bill the same amount every month?

retrieved: tuition-and-billing=0.528, billing-cycle-2026-2027=0.526, tuition-rates=0.373, discounts=0.349

A: Tuition is billed monthly by the number of classes scheduled in each month, so the amount changes when months have different numbers of class sessions. CalColor uses an auto‑renewing monthly subscription and prorates billing (you only pay for the classes in that month), and some months include holidays or breaks that reduce class count. Exact per‑class rates also vary by class and campus, so month-to-month totals depend on (1) how many classes fall in that billing cycle and (2) the per‑class rate for your campus. For the most accurate month-by-month amounts for your student, check your campus StudioDirector portal or contact the front desk at (408) 818-8818.

