===== [123/150]  What's the refund policy if I cancel summer camp last minute? =====

Q: What's the refund policy if I cancel summer camp last minute?

retrieved: cancellation-refund-policy=0.666, summer-camp-pricing=0.631, faq-pause-class-travel=0.482, discounts=0.470

A: The camp refund policy applies to all situations without exception.

- Within 24 hours of payment: full refund, no processing fee.
- Until April 1: 100% refund minus a $25 processing fee per session canceled.
- Until May 1: 75% refund (or school credit).
- Until 2 weeks before camp start: 50% refund (or school credit).
- Within 2 weeks of camp start: no refund, credit, or camp switch.

To cancel camp, email your campus.

